WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.251
A link keeps its address inside the opening tag

2
00:00:04.206 --> 00:00:08.756
&lt;a&gt; makes a link. The words between &lt;a&gt; and &lt;/a&gt; are what people click.

3
00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:13.558
href goes inside the opening tag and says where the link goes.

4
00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:20.196
Only the words show. The address stays hidden inside the tag.
